==Format==
* 2 Divisions - [[2018_QW_Duel_Showdown/Div1|Professional League]] & [[2018_QW_Duel_Showdown/Div2|Casual League]]
* Single elemination, all games {{abbr|BO5|Best of 5}}
* Third place deciders will be played
* Please review the full [[2018_QW_Duel_Showdown/Rules|rules here]].
